# Shell scripts are executed inside Linux containers, from the checkout on
# the host: a CRLF checkout makes /bin/sh fail with
# "set: illegal option -" and ": not found". Keep them LF everywhere,
# whatever core.autocrlf says on the machine doing the checkout.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.sql text eol=lf

*.gpkg binary
